  "prefLabel": "Ncr 735.04 Limits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 735.04 Limits. The following shall apply to all users when utilizing the Franconia Notch recreational trail:\n\n(a) A person operating a bicycle shall not exceed 20 mph at any time;\n\n(b) No person operating a bicycle shall exceed the speed of any person walking in a designated walking speed zone;\n\n(c) All trail users, including pedestrians, shall keep to the right of the trail except when passing;\n\n(d) No person shall operate a bicycle between ½ hour after sunset and ½ hour before sunrise; and\n\n(e) No person shall operate a bicycle when that trail is closed by the park manager for maintenance reasons or for restrictions in public use pursuant to Ncr 731.07.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr700.html"
